@startuml system-context
title FishMap - System Context Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
}

actor "Angler\n(registered user)" as Angler

rectangle "FishMap system\n\nMobile application, backend (API gateway\nand services), database, AI module" as FishMap #DDEEFF

rectangle "Map provider\n(map tiles and geodata)" as MapProvider #F5F5F5
rectangle "Weather service\n(Open-Meteo API)" as Weather #F5F5F5
rectangle "External AI service\n(LLM API, optional)" as LLM #F5F5F5

Angler --> FishMap : plans trips, records spots,\ncatches and equipment,\nviews statistics and recommendations
FishMap --> Angler : map, weather, species suggestions,\nrecommendations, notifications
FishMap --> MapProvider : requests map data
FishMap --> Weather : requests weather data
FishMap --> LLM : requests for fishing assistant\n(optional)

legend bottom
  Blue: system developed in this project. Grey: external systems.
endlegend
@enduml
